    "description": "Risk info sheet, second paragraph: the four signals and their weights."
  },
  "riskInfoMissing": "A signal the app cannot read is named under the score and left out of the sum — never counted as a calm day. The percentage is a share of what could actually be read, so a day with no sleep data is not a low day.",
